{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768940/extras/BandCSmooth.gif?t=1749773487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Building beautiful cities has never been simpler in this charming design game. Place blocks on an organic grid to form buildings, parks, trees and water. Combine multiple types of blocks to create everything from charming plazas to sprawling cities. Customize colors, doors, roofs, towers and more. Find unique interactions between blocks, and recruit villagers and animals to your city. Relax and experience the joy of creation in this cozy city builder.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build and Customize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change colors and styles on the fly. Add doors and bridges. Raise up towers and spires. On an organic grid each structure has its own distinct features.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768940?t=1749773487","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768940/886c975dfbb2515c3b26287bc7c1b43675708d77/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749773487","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768940/d0e6c24dfa21fa04c32589d97dd2cce62de609da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749773487","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768940/d0e6c24dfa21fa04c32589d97dd2cce62de609da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749773487","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor